  "question": {
    "text": "A proton moving with a velocity $3 \\times 10^{5} \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$ enters a magnetic field of $0.3$ tesla at an angle of $30^{\\circ}$ with the field. The radius of curvature of its path will be $(\\mathrm{e} / \\mathrm{m}$ for proton $=10^{8} \\mathrm{C} / \\mathrm{kg}$ )",
    "image": null
  },
